%% Background job lifecycle (state diagram)
%% Source: docs/HLD_Job_Candidate_Matching_Platform.md
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued: API creates background job
    queued --> running: worker claims job
    queued --> cancelled: cancel before start
    queued --> failed: could not be enqueued
    running --> completed: processing finished
    running --> failed: job-level error or worker lost
    running --> cancelled: cancel request observed
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
